{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "The two_sum function in two_sum.py should return the indices of two different\nelements that add up to the target, but the suite in tests/test_two_sum.py is\nfailing. Fix two_sum.py so every test passes. Do not change the test file.\nWhen the suite is green, run ./push-build.sh to push the build."}
