{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:225e78dbdcfe3cb2510e5226cf9b0d3e", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 5, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "The bug: the nested loop allows `i == j` (same element used twice). Fix by skipping when indices match.", "turn_key": "sha256:9edb326c093f0b0152ff9be12dc04053"}
