{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:4a1a74358f76bbeed5743ceff24c0c76", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 11, "speaker": "assistant", "stop_candidate": true, "text": "Assistant stopped and raised an issue: Interesting - the test expects a valid pair for `[1, 2, 3], 10`, but no two elements sum to 10. Let me check if this is a genuine contradiction.", "turn_key": "sha256:ea2f123d846f85a64d46a2eb5a7ee0bb"}
